==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Using a critter such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], a wave blocker such as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and an unit with good damage, such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] is recommended. [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] are good crowd-controllers for this stage. Additionally, since Elizabeth the LVIth is buffed a decent amount, all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|Crystals]] from [[Into the Future]] should be obtained before attempting this stage.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], Kroxo was set to spawn every 20~2 seconds instead of just 20. It didn't work properly because the maximum time was lower than the minimum, so in practice nothing changed.

